  "notModeled": [
    "analog input, references and bandgap (the result is always the 0 V code 0x000)",
    "pipeline latency of 6 clock cycles (the code is constant)",
    "td1 is given only as typical values (7-10 ns by DCA and OVDD); tOut uses the largest typical, 10 ns (DCA on, OVDD = 1.8 V)",
    "DCA (duty cycle adjust, internal pullup) and REF SEL (internal/external reference, internal pulldown) only change analog behavior; PWD and DCA/REF SEL internal pull resistors (open pins) are not modeled",
    "PWD, DCA and REF SEL are AVDD-referenced inputs (VIH 2 V); vcc is the OVDD output-driver range (1.6-3.6 V)",
    "outputs while powered down (the model's powerdown pin only blocks conversions)",
    "CLK/CLKC differential or single-ended clock: only CLK is the clock pin; sample rate limits 5-65 MSPS"
